{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1787896893, "idle_time_limit": 4.0, "env": {}, "title": "scanr — 10. Tuning: the proxy is the limit"}
[0.010727, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2;36m# The number that decides a proxied scan is the proxy's own connection cap.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.412042, "o", "\u001b[2;36m# --calibrate reproduces a scan's churn at rising concurrency and finds it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.813604, "o", "\u001b[2;36m# exit-b is 3proxy at its default maxconn 100.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
